    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "*** Vacant Homes Grant available to qualified applicants****\r\n\r\nCME are delighted to bring to the market, this very well maintained, 4 bedroom home set in this highly sought after development, close to all the amenities of Newbridge. No.199 benefits from large gardens to front and rear and is situated overlooking a very well maintained green space with an abundance of mature trees, offering privacy and an attractive vista to look upon.\r\nLovingly maintained throughout the years, this fine home offers well proportioned and versatile accommodation, as well as offering excellent potential for any discerning purchaser to further improve and create a dream home.\r\nThe Oaks in one of the most mature and sought after developments in Newbridge, located within a short stroll of the town centre and a multitude of facilities including the renowned Whitewater Shopping Centre, Dunnes Stores, Tesco, ALDI and SuperValu, to name but a few. Newbridge also offers excellent transport facilities including Train, bus and Motorway routes, allowing an option to commute if required. Newbridge College is close by as well as a good selection of primary and secondary schools, with Scoil Mhuire Primary school being literally around the corner.\r\nViewing of this fine home is highly recommended and by appointment with CME."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall: \r\nc. 2.8m x 1.42m\r\nComposite front door. Carpeted flooring. Storage area (x2) \r\n\r\nGuest WC:\r\nc.1.6m x 1m\r\nWith WC and wash hand basin. Fully tiled. \r\n\r\nSitting room:\r\nc. 4.85m x 3.64m\r\nStone fireplace housing electric fire inset. Coving to ceiling and centre rose. Wall lights. Carpeted flooring. Large picture window. Double doors with bevelled glazing leading to.. \r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room:\r\nc. 6.9m x 3.3m\r\nRange of wall & floor mounted cream kitchen units incorporating stainless steel sink unit, glass display units and worksurfaces. Tiled floor to kitchen area, laminate wood flooring to dining area. Door to rear garden. 2 windows affording maximum light. \r\n\r\nFirst Floor:\r\nLanding: \r\nc.2.2m x 1.85m\r\nCarpeted floor, Hotpress.\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom:\r\nc. 3.8m x 3.8m\r\nFront aspect. Carpeted flooring.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2:\r\nc. 2.6m x 3.1m\r\nFront aspect. Carpet flooring.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3:\r\nc. 4.5m x 2.6m\r\nRear aspect. Carpet flooring.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4:\r\nc.2.5m x 2.5m\r\nRear aspect. Carpet flooring.\r\n\r\nBathroom: \r\nc. 2.5m x 1.6m\r\nRefurbished to provide large shower enclosure, vanity wash hand basin and storage beneath and WC. Fully tiled walls and floor.\r\n\r\nOutside: To the front and side there are very well maintained and planted gardens with mature, trees shrubs and gated driveway. Large patio and lawn to rear with large wooden shed."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Vacant Homes Grant available to qualified applicants\r\nVery well presented 4 bedroom family home on a spacious site.\r\nOil Fired central heating. \r\nLarge gardens with an abundance of mature shrubs, planting and trees.\r\nSought after & established estate. \r\nShort walk to the town centre, Whitewater Shopping Centre, Dunnes Stores, Tesco etc. \r\n5 minutes to M7 junction/ c.7 mins drive to Train station \r\nAccessible to a host of local schools & facilities. \r\nRecently refurbished Bathroom \r\nGuest WC"
      },
